{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The sun and the moon.</b> For they are the great luminaries, and after saying \"and the stars,\" He explained in a general term all the host of heaven: the wandering stars, which are the stars of light, and all the constellations and the forms." "<b>And you will be driven.</b> Like a person who is shoved and falls." "<b>Which He allotted.</b> It is a well-known matter, for every nation has a designated star and constellation, and likewise every city has a constellation, and HaShem appointed for Israel a great elevation, that HaShem is their counselor and they have no star; and behold, Israel is the inheritance of HaShem."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {2 "Resolved השם uniformly as HaShem per voice rules; the word appears three times in this comment."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:15.788062045Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}